      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787589269960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- React is a library and not a framework, which means React\nonly provides a way to update the UI on state change and\nnothing else\n- React by default does not have any routing capabilities,\nstyling capabilities, state management, API calling etc, all\nthose things are achieved by third party libraries or meta-\nframeworks\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Uo7NI7d3vB98yUNL0Z-pQ",
      "originalText": "- React is a library and not a framework, which means React only provides a way to update the UI on state change and nothing else\n- React by default does not have any routing capabilities, styling capabilities, state management, API calling etc, all those things are achieved by third party libraries or meta-frameworks\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VgbLGke77vh7f8mY8sg_H",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 154.3408409120188,
