      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787595615168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UI/Client State: This state lives purely on the UI, is never synced with BE. \nFor example: \n- UI light/dark theme\n- Link active or not\n- Side nav toggle\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "OiKaq9LAQoaSBESJ5VQSO",
      "originalText": "UI/Client State: This state lives purely on the UI, is never synced with BE. \nFor example: \n- UI light/dark theme\n- Link active or not\n- Side nav toggle\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pyAaUXnMgIPJDN68rC-zl",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -27.234729654531577,
      "y": 2732.8021351778193,
      "width": 866.4675826823398,
      "height": 335,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1624389859,
      "version": 683,
      "versionNonce": 143985763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LeKfZnl_VOdu5ZVrt1_YU"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787595834537,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LeKfZnl_VOdu5ZVrt1_YU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14.590629475471076,
      "y": 2737.8021351778193,
      "width": 841.1793823242188,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 545203331,
      "version": 1174,
      "versionNonce": 1596602499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787595797156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API/Server State: This state comes from a server usually via a API call, REST, GQL\netc\nThe challenges of a server state are very different from Client state\n- Caching\n- Deduping\n- Updating \"out of date\" data in abckground\n- Pagination\n- Lazy loading\n\n\nThese challenges makes server state management very different from client state and\nrequires state management solution specific to the need of server state.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pyAaUXnMgIPJDN68rC-zl",
      "originalText": "API/Server State: This state comes from a server usually via a API call, REST, GQL etc\nThe challenges of a server state are very different from Client state\n- Caching\n- Deduping\n- Updating \"out of date\" data in abckground\n- Pagination\n- Lazy loading\n\n\nThese challenges makes server state management very different from client state and requires state management solution specific to the need of server state.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
